<title>USA: Feb 10-14 program trading 13.0 pct of NYSE volume.</title>
<headline>Feb 10-14 program trading 13.0 pct of NYSE volume.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said on Thursday that program trading amounted to 13.0 percent of the exchange's average daily volume for the week of February 10-14.</p>
<p>For all markets that week, program trading averaged 94.3 million shares a day.</p>
<p>	  ((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
